# XM Bakery Stock & Order Management API

## Features
- Authentication
- Product management
- Order management
- Inventory tracking
- Reports

## Technologies
- Node.js
- Express.js
- MongoDB
- JWT

## Installation
npm install

## Run
npm run dev

## Environment Variables
MONGO_URI=mongodb://localhost:27017/XMBakeries
JWT_SECRET=your_secret_key
PORT=8000

## API Endpoints
/api/auth
/api/products
/api/orders
/api/reports